{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 418, "line_no": 13, "text": "“娱乐类”几种。", "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 980, "w": 282, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“娱乐类”几种。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 80, "y": 980, "w": 282, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 418, "line_no": 14, "text": "生产类。这类体育项目与人们的生产活动具有密切关系。它从生产劳动中产生，并", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1042, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "生产类。这类体育项目与人们的生产活动具有密切关系。它从生产劳动中产生，并", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1042, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 418, "line_no": 15, "text": "反映生产劳动的内容。这类体育项目有“游水追鸭”", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1110, "w": 913, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "反映生产劳动的内容。这类体育项目有“游水追鸭”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1110, "w": 913, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
