{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 418, "line_no": 20, "text": "，等等。平塘一带布依族的“拔萝卜”、“打飞鼠”等活动有娱乐", "bbox_px": {"x": 510, "y": 1168, "w": 1122, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "，等等。平塘一带布依族的“拔萝卜”、“打飞鼠”等活动有娱乐", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 510, "y": 1168, "w": 1122, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
